 font-size="32px" font-weight="normal" color="black.900" class="sc-1709896-0 bWUsCp">Connect</h2><div display="inline-block" cursor="help" data-cy="tooltip-trigger" class="sc-5062b090-2 bPxdsG"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" height="18" width="18" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" color="#76777A" class="StyledIconBase-sc-ea9ulj-0 cyQuJj"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><line x1="12" x2="12" y1="16" y2="12"></line><line x1="12" x2="12.01" y1="8" y2="8"></line></svg></div></div><hr class="sc-d0d050d8-0 hGzNES"/></div><div class="sc-d3b1f0c-0 sc-d3b1f0c-1 frKAFo wSTCA"><p color="black.700" class="sc-dcb94ee2-0 sc-b1a93422-3 byZndi fmgVAn">Let’s get the ball rolling!</p></div></div><section id="section-updates" data-cy="section-updates" class="sc-3340244f-0 iTPjmR"><div class="sc-9ed2d16a-0 sc-7355880b-0 czvsjw"><h2 font-size="20px,24px,32px" color="black.700" font-weight="normal" class="sc-1709896-0 NVTKe">News from ESLint</h2><div class="sc-d3b1f0c-0 sc-d3b1f0c-1 iVvBqZ hvfLzF"><p color="black.700" class="sc-dcb94ee2-0 sc-7234a878-1 eEeoYU blMYZB">Updates on our activities and progress.</p></div><div class="sc-d3b1f0c-0 hncGsq"><div class="sc-2c35d607-0 fURMss"><div class="sc-9ed2d16a-0 CaGOk"><div class="sc-d3b1f0c-0 sc-d3b1f0c-1 jzMvMa csvMWi"><div class="sc-d3b1f0c-0 qIesT"><a title="Nicholas C. Zakas" class="hover:underline" href="/nzakas"><div style="background-image:url(https://images.opencollective.com/nzakas/84e180e/avatar.png?height=80);background-size:cover" size="40" type="INDIVIDUAL" src="https://images.opencollective.com/nzakas/84e180e/avatar.png?height=80" title="Nicholas C. Zakas" class="sc-d3b1f0c-0 sc-d3b1f0c-1 jFejKr fGEJMP sc-ff045f41-0 fEQhME"></div></a></div><div class="sc-d3b1f0c-0 sc-d3b1f0c-1 giVqMW eDZLcq"><a href="/eslint/updates/eslints-2025-year-in-review"><p color="black.900" font-weight="600" class="sc-dcb94ee2-0 hAeQmn">ESLint&#x27;s 2025 year in review</p></a><div class="sc-9ed2d16a-0 dgVncz"><div><div style="display:inline" font-size="14px" class="sc-63bf996f-0 bKpumw sc-63bf996f-2 kyqQih">Hi everyone, 2025 was a great year for ESLint with a lot to show for our work. Please take a moment to review my blog post where I talk about everything that happened on the project:...</div></div> <a class="sc-7169fd69-0 ilEXhu" font-size="12px" color="primary.500" href="/eslint/updates/eslints-2025-year-in-review">Read more</a></div><div color="black.600" font-size="12px" class="sc-9ed2d16a-0 ccmCzU">Published on February 5, 2026 by <a title="Nicholas C. Zakas" class="hover:underline" href="/nzakas">Nicholas C. Zakas</a></div></div></div></div><div class="sc-9ed2d16a-0 CaGOk"><div class="sc-d3b1f0c-0 sc-d3b1f0c-1 jzMvMa csvMWi"><div class="sc-d3b1f0c-0 qIesT"><a title="Nicholas C. Zakas" class="hover:underline" href="/nzakas"><div style="background-image:url(https://images.opencollective.com/nzakas/84e180e/avatar.png?height=80);background-size:cover" size="40" type="INDIVIDUAL" src="https://images.opencollective.com/nzakas/84e180e/avatar.png?height=80" title="Nicholas C. Zakas" class="sc-d3b1f0c-0 sc-d3b1f0c-1 jFejKr fGEJMP sc-ff045f41-0 fEQhME"></div></a></div><div class="sc-d3b1f0c-0 sc-d3b1f0c-1 giVqMW eDZLcq"><a href="/eslint/updates/eslints-2024-year-in-review"><p color="black.900" font-weight="600" class="sc-dcb94ee2-0 hAeQmn">ESLint&#x27;s 2024 Year in Review</p></a><div class="sc-9ed2d16a-0 dgVncz"><div><div style="display:inline" font-size="14px" class="sc-63bf996f-0 bKpumw sc-63bf996f-2 kyqQih">After taking a look at 2024, we&#x27;ve put together our year in review. Some of the highlights: 🚀Launched v9.0.0 with new config system.🔌Created language-specific plugins for JSON, Markdown, and CSS.🔍Launched Code Explorer.💸Ran at a nearly...</div></div> <a class="sc-7169fd69-0 ilEXhu" font-size="12px" color="primary.500" href="/eslint/updates/eslints-2024-year-in-review">Read more</a></div><div color="black.600" font-size="12px" class="sc-9ed2d16a-0 ccmCzU">Published on January 22, 2025 by <a title="Nicholas C. Zakas" class="hover:underline" href="/nzakas">Nicholas C. Zakas</a></div></div></div></div><div class="sc-9ed2d16a-0 bKpiA-d"><div class="sc-d3b1f0c-0 sc-d3b1f0c-1 jzMvMa csvMWi"><div class="sc-d3b1f0c-0 qIesT"><a title="Nicholas C. Zakas" class="hover:underline" href="/nzakas"><div style="background-image:url(https://images.opencollective.com/nzakas/84e180e/avatar.png?height=80);background-size:cover" size="40" type="INDIVIDUAL" src="https://images.opencollective.com/nzakas/84e180e/avatar.png?height=80" title="Nicholas C. Zakas" class="sc-d3b1f0c-0 sc-d3b1f0c-1 jFejKr fGEJMP sc-ff045f41-0 fEQhME"></div></a></div><div class="sc-d3b1f0c-0 sc-d3b1f0c-1 giVqMW eDZLcq"><a href="/eslint/updates/eslint-now-support-linting-of-json-and-markdown"><p color="black.900" font-weight="600" class="sc-dcb94ee2-0 hAeQmn">ESLint now support linting of JSON and Markdown</p></a><div class="sc-9ed2d16a-0 dgVncz"><div><div style="display:inline" font-size="14px" class="sc-63bf996f-0 bKpumw sc-63bf996f-2 kyqQih">Today we <a href="https://opencollective.com/redirect?url=https%3A%2F%2Feslint.org%2Fblog%2F2024%2F10%2Feslint-json-markdown-support%2F">announced</a> official support for linting JSON and Markdown in ESLint. A lot of the changes we made in...</div></div> <a class="sc-7169fd69-0 ilEXhu" font-size="12px" color="primary.500" href="/eslint/updates/eslint-now-support-linting-of-json-and-markdown">Read more</a></div><div color="black.600" font-size="12px" class="sc-9ed2d16a-0 ccmCzU">Published on October 3, 2024 by <a title="Nicholas C. Zakas" class="hover:underline" href="/nzakas">Nicholas C. Zakas</a></div></div></div></div></div><a href="/eslint/updates"><button data-cy="view-all-updates-btn" width="1" font-size="14px" class="sc-532480db-0 fvwWQl">View all updates<!-- --> →</button></a></div></div></section><div id="category-ABOUT" class="sc-9ed2d16a-0 sc-b1a93422-0 EBMGw bxETTS"><div class="sc-d3b1f0c-0 sc-d3b1f0c-1 fqoDra ferUGe"><div class="sc-d3b1f0c-0 sc-d3b1f0c-1 sc-b1a93422-2 htvGag faHCM cHAEpw"><img src="/static/images/collective-navigation/CollectiveNavbarIconAbout.png" alt="" class="sc-b1a93422-1 dWuXCV"/></div><div class="sc-d3b1f0c-0 sc-d3b1f0c-1 kelEPL fHSAwH"><h2 data-cy="category-ABOUT-title" font-size="32px" font-weight="normal" color="black.900" class="sc-1709896-0 bWUsCp">About</h2></div><hr class="sc-d0d050d8-0 hGzNES"/></div></div><section id="section-about" data-cy="section-about" class="sc-3340244f-0 iTPjmR"><div class="sc-9ed2d16a-0 sc-7355880b-0 cIqaQH"><div class="sc-9ed2d16a-0 eRmECd"><div class="sc-9ed2d16a-0 jRaTqn"><div><div data-cy="longDescription" font-size="14px" class="sc-63bf996f-0 bKpumw sc-63bf996f-2 kyqQih"><div>ESLint is an open source project that helps developers find and fix problems with their JavaScript code. It&#x27;s the number one JavaScript linter by downloads on npm (over 6.5 million downloads per week) and is used at companies like Microsoft, Airbnb, Netflix, and Facebook. Due to ESLint&#x27;s flexibility, it&#x27;s also able to help find and fix problems in JavaScript derivative languages such as Flow and TypeScript, as well as for mobile development with React Native.<br/><br/></div><div>This collective supports the team that is developing ESLint. The funds collected are intended to support dedicated staff, compensate those who are regularly contributing to ESLint, and hire freelancers to help with needs we can&#x27;t otherwise meet. Funding also allows us to send team members to conferences, companies, and meetups to meet with our users to discuss and solve the problems they are facing.<br/><br/><strong>Note:</strong> We do not accept donations from gambling sites, paper writing services, political groups, hate groups, adult entertainment sites, or any other organization who we don&#x27;t believe is contributing for the good of the project. We don&#x27;t offer advertising and we don&#x27;t give refunds. We are an open source project looking for financial support from our users. <br/><br/></div><div><em>This Collective is run by and for the benefit of the independent contributors to the ESLint open source software project. This Collective is not endorsed or administered by OpenJS Foundation, Inc. (the “OpenJS Foundation”), the OpenJS Foundation does not receive and has no control over any funds contributed, the OpenJS Foundation does not direct or otherwise supervise the actions of any contributor to the ESLint project, and all donations made will be expended for the private benefit of or otherwise to reimburse individuals that do not have an employer/employee, contractor, or other agency relationship with the OpenJS Foundation. The ESLint marks used herein are used under license from the OpenJS Foundation for the benefit of the open source software community.<br/></em><br/></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section id="section-our-team" data-cy="section-our-team" class="sc-3340244f-0 eGKBUl"><div class="sc-9ed2d16a-0 sc-7355880b-0 jyulmr"><div class="sc-9ed2d16a-0 uzGKt"><h2 font-weight="500" color="black.700" class="sc-dcb94ee2-0 sc-dcb94ee2-5 kmgLsS">Our team</h2><div class="sc-9ed2d16a-0 bGxwtX"><div width="144" height="auto" class="sc-2c35d607-0 sc-d82cae7-0 bfQJEs gMcYKv"><div class="sc-d82cae7-1 jfGyLV"><div class="sc-d3b1f0c-0 inLDtj"><a href="/nzakas"><div style="background-image:url(https://images.opencollective.com/nzakas/84e180e/avatar.png);background-size:cover" size="64" type="USER" src="https://images.opencollective.com/nzakas/84e180e/avatar.png" title="Nicholas C. Zakas" class="sc-d3b1f0c-0 sc-d3b1f0c-1 kFsjOb cskNqH sc-ff045f41-0 iEGXco"></div></a></div></div><div class="sc-d3b1f0c-0 sc-d3b1f0c-1 iJlvnw hqNDzM"><a href="/nzakas"><p color="black.900" font-weight="500" title="Nicholas C. Zakas" class="sc-dcb94ee2-0 boFGUd">Nicholas C. Z...</p></a><div class="sc-d3b1f0c-0 gmTaiH"><div class="sc-afa001f2-0 fZtaHx sc-d82cae7-4 kJsbDm">Admin</div></div><div class="sc-d3b1f0c-0 eVvpCT"></div></div></div><div width="144" height="auto" class="sc-2c35d607-0 sc-d82cae7-0 bfQJEs gMcYKv"><div class="sc-d82cae7-1 jfGyLV"><div class="sc-d3b1f0c-0 inLDtj"><a href="/milos-djermanovic"><div style="background-image:url(https://images.opencollective.com/milos-djermanovic/11a1644/avatar.png);background-size:cover" size="64" type="USER" src="https://images.opencollective.com/milos-djermanovic/11a1644/avatar.png" title="Milos Djermanovic" class="sc-d3b1f0c-0 sc-d3b1f0c-1 kFsjOb cskNqH sc-ff045f41-0 iEGXco"></div></a></div></div><div class="sc-d3b1f0c-0 sc-d3b1f0c-1 iJlvnw hqNDzM"><a href="/milos-djermanovic"><p color="black.900" font-weight="500" title="Milos Djermanovic" class="sc-dcb94ee2-0 boFGUd">Milos Djerman...</p></a><div class="sc-d3b1f0c-0 gmTaiH"><div class="sc-afa001f2-0 fZtaHx sc-d82cae7-4 kJsbDm">Admin</div></div><div class="sc-d3b1f0c-0 eVvpCT"></div></div></div><div width="144" height="auto" class="sc-2c35d607-0 sc-d82cae7-0 bfQJEs gMcYKv"><div class="sc-d82cae7-1 jfGyLV"><div class="sc-d3b1f0c-0 inLDtj"><a href="/francesco-trotta"><div style="background-image:url(https://images.opencollective.com/francesco-trotta/58c1972/avatar.png);background-size:cover" size="64" type="USER" src="https://images.opencollective.com/francesco-trotta/58c1972/avatar.png" title="Francesco Trotta" class="sc-d3b1f0c-0 sc-d3b1f0c-1 kFsjOb cskNqH sc-ff045f41-0 iEGXco"></div></a></div></div><div class="sc-d3b1f0c-0 sc-d3b1f0c-1 iJlvnw hqNDzM"><a href="/francesco-trotta"><p color="black.900" font-weight="500" title="Francesco Trotta" class="sc-dcb94ee2-0 boFGUd">Francesco Trotta</p></a><div class="sc-d3b1f0c-0 gmTaiH"><div class="sc-afa001f2-0 fZtaHx sc-d82cae7-4 kJsbDm">Admin</div></div><div class="sc-d3b1f0c-0 eVvpCT"></div></div></div></div><div class="sc-9ed2d16a-0 kRLaeP"><button class="sc-532480db-0 jSUzib"><span class="sc-dcb94ee2-0 sc-dcb94ee2-1 iBBPKT"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" height="